OL,3,ASchools in Italy, Scotland and Northern
OL,4,AIreland hit by threats in suspected
OL,5,Abomb hoax
OL,6,
OL,7,FScotland's education secretary Mairi
OL,8,FMcAllan said there was no risk to the
OL,9,Fpublic and specialist cyber-crime
OL,10,Fofficers were working to identify the
OL,11,Fsource of the messages. In Northern
OL,12,FIreland education officials told
OL,13,Fschools to remain open unless otherwise
OL,14,Fadvised by police.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
